[{"op":"background","image":"bg008c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"阴天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"心情也阴郁。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（不，应该不是天气的原因吧…）"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033ac"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"背后传来有人小跑过来的脚步声。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「早上好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着，古河已经自然而然地走在我的身边。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦，早…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如此回答完毕，我又沉默起来。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg011c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":2},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学，我有一个提议。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当走到坡道口的时候，古河开口说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「今天放学后，来打篮球吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谁要去打篮球啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学和我两个人啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「放学后，我在操场等你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「我会拿着篮球，等你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是太明显了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你是不是傻啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「别看我这样，其实运动神经很好的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不是这个意思…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「要是从下往上抛，还能够投篮呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「站着不动的时候，运球也没问题。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…你那算是运动白痴吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「咦？是这样的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以你就不要多此一举了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「还是多考虑一下演剧部的事吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「可是，我想多知道一些冈崎同学的事啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「知道什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「能够拼命去做的事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是一个和我最不搭调的词。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"事到如今，我已经想不出有什么事情能让我拼命了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在努力之后没有获得回报的是谁来着？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是令人作呕。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你要是想玩，就自己一个人去玩吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「不行，我想两个人一起。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我今天要先回去了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我这么说完，就走向自己的教室。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg016c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"透过窗户抬头看向阴郁的天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河是不是抱着篮球，在操场某处等着我啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从这里看不到她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，我便呆呆地盯着天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…但愿不要下雨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只能如此祈祷着。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":127,"condition":["==",["v","f",211],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然有个人来找我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转过头…是智代。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「看来你真劝住他了啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「今天什么事都没发生。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，已经没事了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（因为你已经证明了你比较强…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…要是我真这么说了，不知她会露出什么表情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，帮大忙了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过之前这么热闹，搞得现在反而有点寂寞。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「会吗。你自己不也有朋友吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「当然有了，大家都是很不错的家伙。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我不是说他们不好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过，有点循规蹈矩了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你们这样爱胡闹的就挺好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…她这是在夸人吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不就是为了向那个方向发展才来这所学校的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「像我们这样的，忽略掉就好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「可现在不是已经牵扯上关系了吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哪怕是你讨厌的人？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「哪怕是我讨厌的人，招呼还是要打的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「顺带一提，我可不讨厌你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「呃，他的话…也不讨厌。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你还真是宽宏大量啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，没错，宽宏大量。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「充满了母爱。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你不觉得这样很有女孩子的感觉吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「与其说是女孩子…更像是大姐姐。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你很没礼貌啊，我算是妹妹。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也是，别放心上。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「你似乎是有意见？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，那就聊到这吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「今天我要和同班同学一起回家。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「让他们久等可不好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，那你赶紧走吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「怎么感觉你在赶人走啊，不是应该更依依不舍地目送我离开吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那求你别走了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，虽然你这么说我很开心，但可惜不行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我得守约。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那再见。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她转过身，英姿飒爽地离去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我则走向反方向的楼梯口。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg030c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看见古河了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她抱着球，一直在等着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不想跟她说自己放弃篮球的原因。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但她，大概会一直努力让我说出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这个状态实在是太让人郁闷了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（等天暗下来，她应该就会回去了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我混在没有社团活动的学生中间，离开了学校。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg046c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱，门被打开了。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呼…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呜哇，有人在里面。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「欢迎回来。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我说你啊…别擅自跑别人房里啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我都被你吓到了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「下次我会装成一具尸体等你的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那会吓死人的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他关上门，脱下外套。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真是够了，我都要被逼死了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「顺带一提，下次就轮到你了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你老家就在这里，估计老师会登门拜访的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「真的假的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「他们还打算让我升学呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就你？哈哈哈，没戏的啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你也是啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊ー啊…果然还是下起来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原透过窗户看着外面的天空说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这样不就哪儿都去不了吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「居然大中午的就要和一个男人在房间里独处…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那你出去吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这是我的房间好吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，比你一个人待着强吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要不我们两个，去玩在雨中裸奔假装神经病的游戏吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「猜拳输掉的春原，要去雨中裸奔假装神经病。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「什么叫输掉的春原…那输掉的冈崎呢！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，我们开始吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「剪刀石头布！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我赢了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「该死。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「再来一次，剪刀石头布！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我连胜了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你赶紧输掉去裸奔吧，剪刀石头布！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么样，三连胜！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，非要我出去裸奔这猜拳游戏才算完吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这绝对是欺负人好吧！」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们躺在地上，一个劲地看着杂志。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听声音就知道，雨越下越大。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「雨这么大，室外的活动都要停止了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「橄榄球部的人应该也会回来…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「拜托你了，给我安分一点。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（该不会…那么大的雨，还在等着我吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（淋到这么大的雨，可不得了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（………）"},{"op":"choice","id":"6419:18020050","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"去看看情况","value":0,"serial":18020050},{"text":"不去理会","value":1,"serial":18020060}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":225,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我出去下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我站了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咦？你要去雨中裸奔？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，差不多吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然不是裸的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"借用了宿舍的公用伞，在雨中狂奔。"},{"op":"goto","to":258},{"op":"ifFalse","to":258,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去确认一下，不也挺好的…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"知道她没有在等着的话…就能松一口气，也没什么不好…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明，没离多远…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg046c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这场雨能停下来就好了…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么了，觉得你好像心事重重的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原的手在我的眼前挥动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「有什么因下雨而让你放不下心的事吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是吗。最近有些干旱呢，我们害我们出不去，但对镇上的人来说是件好事吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我们来求雨再下大点吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚！"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一记重拳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「干…干什么啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我出去下。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咦？你要去雨中裸奔？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，差不多吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我既然知道她有可能在等我，怎么能置之不理呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那还是人吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"借用了宿舍的公用伞，在雨中狂奔。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg011r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg014r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呼哧…呼哧…」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg030r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「古河…」"},{"op":"background","image":"fgng03"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河将球抱在胸口，一动不动地等着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有撑伞全身都湿透了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你是笨蛋吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"飞奔去她身边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「啊，冈崎同学…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「太好了…你来了呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你到底等了多久啊…这不全湿透了吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「这是借来的球…还回去的时候得好好擦干净呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"目光落到胸口的篮球上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「球又不会感冒。你倒是多担心一下自己的身体啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「来，这把伞给你，快回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把伞递给她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"黄豆般的雨珠落在自己头上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「不，我们来打篮球吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这么湿的球场要怎么打啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「打不了啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「打不了的。乖乖回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「那至少让我看一下你的投篮。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「我想要看一看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「我还从来没有近距离看过篮球部员的投篮。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「肯定比我这种外行的泼水投篮要好看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「像这样，帅气地摆好姿势投出去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「所以我想要看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「拜托了。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg030r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将球塞进了我的怀里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然只能给她看了吗…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把伞扔在地上，接下了球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是我暌违多少年的触球了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"缓缓转过身，和被雨淋湿的球场相对而立。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是啊…给她看看就好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看过之后，她也能接受了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"准备把球举过肩膀。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，球在半途滚落。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"掉落在潮湿的地面上，溅起泥水。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"捡起球，想要再一次举起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是手臂依然无力地垂下，让球砸在地面上。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",329],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"fgng03"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河目瞪口呆。似乎没能理解的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「其实啊，古河。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯，在。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我，做不到。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯…？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「如你所见，我没办法投篮。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「手根本抬不起来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「之前肩膀受过伤，然后就一直这样…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她在想些什么呢…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是，呆呆望着球场上的篮球。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是不是在为自以为是的温柔所懊悔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"──肯定比我这种外行的泼水投篮要好看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"──像这样，帅气地摆好姿势投出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对我这样抬不起手的人说出的那些话，现在一定萦绕在她的脑海里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「对不起…我不知道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「我，果然是个笨蛋…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「对不起…」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg030r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我知道在她转身离去的瞬间，眼泪一定掉了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看到了她颤动的脸颊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河抱起沾满泥水的篮球，跑着离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这下她终于是能回家了…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（那家伙，会很失落吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现实太过于辛辣了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下次见面的时候，该开口和她说些什么呢。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"bg046c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哇，你这不是湿了个透了吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…我是跑回来的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哼…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪嗒…啪嗒…啪嗒…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「擦干再进来啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「给，毛巾。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「谢谢…好难闻。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你骗谁，我有好好洗过的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哦…我带了点偏见…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要用吹风机的话，浴室那边有。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好…」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，到了傍晚…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我为了去买晚饭，再一次来到雨中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这次有好好撑着伞。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（面包吗…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（可不能当晚饭啊…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想要知道古河…有没有好好回去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这里可没法判断。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（晚饭，还是买其它的吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"进入店里。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，这不是Bigbang山本吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经不是人名而是艺名了。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ｂ"]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":387,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],"蛆虫"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":388},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":391,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我叫冈崎朋也。」"},{"op":"goto","to":393},{"op":"ifFalse","to":393,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我叫冈崎。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ａ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":"银河"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.s[].search",[["v","s",1]],["v","s",0]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":399,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1091],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":401},{"op":"ifFalse","to":401,"condition":["!=",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1091],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ｂ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":"银河"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.s[].search",[["v","s",1]],["v","s",0]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":407,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1092],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":409},{"op":"ifFalse","to":409,"condition":["!=",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1092],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ａ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":"宇宙"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.s[].search",[["v","s",1]],["v","s",0]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":415,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1093],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":417},{"op":"ifFalse","to":417,"condition":["!=",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1093],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ｂ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":"宇宙"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.s[].search",[["v","s",1]],["v","s",0]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":423,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1094],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":425},{"op":"ifFalse","to":425,"condition":["!=",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1094],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ａ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":"太空"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.s[].search",[["v","s",1]],["v","s",0]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":431,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1095],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":433},{"op":"ifFalse","to":433,"condition":["!=",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1095],"value":1},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ｂ"]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",1],"value":"太空"},{"op":"set","target":["v","a",1000],"value":["call","global.s[].search",[["v","s",1]],["v","s",0]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":439,"condition":["==",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1096],"value":0},{"op":"goto","to":441},{"op":"ifFalse","to":441,"condition":["!=",["v","a",1000],["-",1]]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1096],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":459,"condition":["&&",["&&",["&&",["&&",["&&",["==",["v","f",1091],0],["==",["v","f",1092],0]],["==",["v","f",1093],0]],["==",["v","f",1094],0]],["==",["v","f",1095],0]],["==",["v","f",1096],0]]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「对，是叫这个来着。我记得你是有那么个蛆虫般的名字。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ａ"]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":448,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],"蛆虫"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1091],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":449},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1091],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ｂ"]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":453,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],"蛆虫"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1092],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":454},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1092],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":458,"condition":["||",["==",["v","f",1091],1],["==",["v","f",1092],1]]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「说来，这不就是叫蛆虫吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「仔细想想你这名字超厉害的啊…」"},{"op":"goto","to":464},{"op":"ifFalse","to":462,"condition":["||",["||",["==",["v","f",1091],1],["==",["v","f",1093],1]],["==",["v","f",1095],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，对了…好宏伟的…」"},{"op":"goto","to":464},{"op":"ifFalse","to":464,"condition":["||",["||",["==",["v","f",1092],1],["==",["v","f",1094],1]],["==",["v","f",1096],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哦，是吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「那么，有什么事，买东西吗？今天是客人啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「你会买走早苗的面包对吧。会把卖剩下的全部买走对吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「喂，把钱拿出来。你身上有不少吧？最近的父母很宽松的。快，跳几下听听。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"简直就是打劫小学生的混混。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不是来买东西的。古河那家伙回来了吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「老子就是古河。要叫我秋生大人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是你。是说你女儿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「什么嘛，渚啊。你找渚什么事。可不许做坏事啊小子。阉了你哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你家女儿渚回来了吗，现在人在吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「哼，我就不告诉你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「怎么样，买面包不。买的话我就告诉你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「哎呀，大十字冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…差一点。只对了冈崎那一半。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我叫冈崎。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「啊，不好意思，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「渚回来了吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「没，今天还没回来呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「唉，早苗，别这么轻易就告诉他啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「为什么呀？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嗯，就是…那啥…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这位大叔，想以这个答案为要挟，让我买下你的面包。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「因为不这么做就卖不出去。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「嘁…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「真的吗，秋生。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「不，不是的，早苗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我的面包…我的面包…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"眼泪开始打转。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「原来是古河面包店的累赘呢ー…！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰啦一下就跑开了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak18e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「早苗…！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak16e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「可，可恶…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河父亲将好几个卖剩的面包塞到嘴里…"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak15e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「我最喜欢了ーーー！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边吼着一边追了出去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只能在一旁傻看着这出闹剧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「呃…我可没时间陪他们胡闹。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河没有回来。这可不得了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我再一次走了出去。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身后传来了声音。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn14e"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","s",0],"value":["call","global.namae",["＊Ａ"]]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":532,"condition":["==",["v","s",0],"宇宙"]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":533},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1090],"value":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":537,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「请等一下，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，怎么了。」"},{"op":"goto","to":540},{"op":"ifFalse","to":540,"condition":["==",["v","f",1090],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「请等一下，写作宇宙的冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，我冈崎就是很普通地写成冈崎的啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那孩子也不在学校吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我虽然看到她离开学校…但不知道之后她去哪里了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn20e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「早该回来了吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我也这么觉得…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「那我去找找看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「店里不要紧吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn10e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「有秋生在。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我还是觉得这个人不在比较好…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我顺着上学路去找找看，呃…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我叫早苗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯…那麻烦早苗阿姨去渚可能去的地方找找看吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早苗阿姨也撑起了伞，跑入了雨中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看着她的背影离开后，我也折回了来路。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一把小小的伞，在道路的尽头晃来晃去的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我顺着路跑过去，原来是一个大概在上小学的小朋友。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是在找什么吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从其身边经过，我朝学校走去。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg011r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg014r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"冷清极了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在活动室和中庭找了一圈…没有发现古河的身影。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg033r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我有气无力地走着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"已经不知道该去哪找了，接下来就交给早苗阿姨吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又在同一个地方看到了一把小伞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我停下脚步，注视了一会。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然耳边听到了一声动物的叫声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转过头，围墙上有一只小狗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"应该是没办法跳下来了，湿淋淋地在颤抖着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我伸出手，抱起了它。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脖子上有项圈。原来如此，我明白了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我走到那孩子的身边，把小狗交给他。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你在找的东西，是这个吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"孩子抬起头。马上就展露出了笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「太好了！你在哪里找到的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那边。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随便指了一下，我决定快点离开。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「啊，等一下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"孩子叫住我。是想要道谢吧。但这样好麻烦，我决定装作没听到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「你认识一个大姐姐吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，听到这句话让我又转了回来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你指谁。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「有个大姐姐。在帮我找小狗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那是你姐姐吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「不，是不认识的人。但是有帮我在一起找。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「穿着校服吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「嗯ー…应该是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「她去哪了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「唔…不知道。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「但她说，找到后会回这里来的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「怎么办…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小朋友摸着小狗湿透的脑袋，不安地说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「已经不早了，你家里人会担心的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「而且继续淋雨的话会感冒的。小狗也一样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「唔…但是…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我会帮你跟大姐姐道谢的。快回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「真的吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「一定要替我说谢谢哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，交给我吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小孩","text":"「再见。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，注意路滑。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小朋友迈着轻快的步伐跑回去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是天真可爱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「接下来…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"过会就会放弃，然后回来了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只能在这里等着了。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg033r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":2},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知过了多久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"湿冷的手都感觉有点冻僵了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有一个没撑伞奔跑在雨中的人影。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",304],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng25z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「终于找到了。还很有精神。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「哇…好冷。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"胸前抱着某只生物的古河回来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是这孩子吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的手中是…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这只哦…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「哎…？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng13z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「啊，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎终于发现了等着的人不是那个小朋友，而是我了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你有没有在这里看见有一个小朋友。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有。只是很晚了我让他先回去了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「不把这只小狗还给他的话。他会担心的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「小狗已经找到了。安安心心回家了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「哎？那么，这孩子是什么呀？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我才想问你好吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「但是，这孩子在护栏边抖个不停。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，这就不是狗吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是，是吗…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她弯下身子。紧紧抱住小野猪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「…我真是个笨蛋呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咳了一声出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你没事吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯…我没事…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着就倒了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你真是笨蛋啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「回家了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我扶起她的肩膀。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg007r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂ー，有人吗ー？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河家没有人在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（连店面都不管了，她父亲在搞什么啊…）"},{"op":"background","image":"bg006"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"顾不上那么多，打算让她躺下的我擅自进了她们家里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（话说，就这么让她躺下的话，会感冒的吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"全身都湿透了。应该连内衣都吸饱水了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但我又不好帮她换衣服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「我回来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正好听到了早苗阿姨的声音。得救了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我把她找回来了。只是全身湿透了，请快帮她换衣服吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsn21e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"早苗","text":"「好的，我知道了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之后就麻烦早苗阿姨吧，我可以走人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再继续留在这里就太不知趣了。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg007r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我从走廊走出来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「欢迎。嘁，原来是你小子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河父亲也回来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「说来，从走廊那边走出来的怎么可能是客人啊…我傻么。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak13e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「快回去。今天已经不想做事情准备关门了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"态度恶劣的古河父亲的刘海，滴答滴答落下大颗的水滴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘴里叼着的烟也灭了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak11e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「唉ー！今天也剩下好多。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak14e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「要不要带点回去，小子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不用了，大叔。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"作为叫我小子的还礼，我重音放在了大叔上。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgak19e"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「唉，真是不可爱。快回去快回去！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拿起放在入口处的伞，离开了面包店。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「喂，小子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"肯定是又想说一些没意义的废话。我装作没听到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"秋生","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最后，夹杂着雨声，我听到了道谢的话语。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg001r"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着我…"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgbt13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"牡丹","text":"「噗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（还得把这家伙送回去啊…）"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"抱起了小野猪。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":782,"condition":["==",["v","f",3],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"走进演剧部的活动室。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg022c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng23z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「啊，冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面只有古河一个人。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「来得那么晚，我有点担心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你在等我？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「自己先练习起来啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「啊，嗯。我知道了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「很好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那么，开始吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我坐到椅子上，望着古河练习的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"差不多练到喉咙哑掉的时候，停了下来。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg020c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng30"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「马上就要下雨了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「早点回去比较好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你带伞了吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「带了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其实没有带。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「那我先走了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河留下一直呆站着的我，自己先离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下雨了早点回家的意思吗…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我又不是那种乖宝宝。"},{"op":"goto","to":903},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",408],"value":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":880,"condition":["==",["v","f",2],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说起文化系的社团活动…我就想起了那家伙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在坡道下遇到的…一个似乎是叫古河的女生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我站在被当做是杂物间的演剧部活动室外面…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在那之后，怎么样了呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在活动室外面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看了看里面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"堆积成山的纸箱已经一扫而空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，古河站在黑板前面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"闭着双眼，手放在胸口，在嘀咕着些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没看到能够交谈的对象。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是说…是演剧的练习了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放心了。她一个人在努力重建演剧部。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"古河把手放下，睁开了眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和在门外往里看的我神眼对上了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「………」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":808,"condition":["==",["v","f",4],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她对着我点头示意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也举起了手打了个招呼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再这么站着不动的话，可能会被误认为我有事，为了不妨碍她练习，我走掉了。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg020c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"goto","to":903},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脸上绽放出笑容，朝我走了过来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唰地一声，拉开门露出了她的脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，你好。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「你好。今天有什么事吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没什么特别的，就是有点在意你是不是好好在练习。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯。托你的福。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「演剧部可以重建了呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「哎？重建，是怎么回事？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你不是重建了演剧部吗。和顾问去说啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「啊，不是…这个…嗯……是我擅自在做的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「擅自？这样的话不会被算作是正式的社团哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这样也行吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「这个…我当然是希望被认可为正式的社团…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「但是，我想已经没有人愿意来演剧了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「所以，演剧部才会消失。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「因此，我觉得靠我一个人的任性是没有办法建立演剧部的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可能你说的对…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但是，不实际去做做的话怎么知道不行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不是吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「…嗯，可能你是对的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「可是，我完全不知道该从何下手。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也是啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「首先，去找找担任过演剧部顾问的老师。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「和那个人商量看看吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯，好的，就这么办。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「之后的话，就是召集部员了…花点时间的话，一定可以重建的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯，谢谢你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「那个…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng19z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「演剧很有意思的。冈崎同学不一起来吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"立马就开始拉人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我就算了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「重要的是气势。就用这份气势去不断拉人吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「刚才因为对象是冈崎同学，我才能说出口的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「可是我，不是上星期刚认识的人吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「话是这样说…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「但是，冈崎同学是在我身后推了我一把的人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我没做那种能令你刮目相看的事。只是些小事而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真的，没什么大不了的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「加油。你能够做到的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这间教室，也是你一个人整理干净的吧？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「就这个势头继续加油吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我深知打扫教室与跟人交流是截然不同的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"需要很大的勇气。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使如此，古河还是乐观地点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，我也放心地离开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「再见啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10z"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「嗯，下次见到的时候，请和我打招呼。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg020c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"goto","to":903},{"op":"ifFalse","to":903,"condition":["==",["v","f",1],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说起文化系的社团活动…我就想起了那家伙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在坡道下遇到的，一个想参加演剧部的女生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我记得演剧部的活动室，也在这一层楼…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"往其中一间活动室看了看。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（哦，在了。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"黑板前，站着一个见过的女生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"闭着双眼，手放在胸口，在嘀咕着些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没看到能够交谈的对象。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是说…是演剧的练习了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但为什么只有她一个人，我有些在意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（之后会慢慢多起来的话…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她把手放下，睁开了眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和在门外往里看的我神眼对上了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"女学生","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她对着我点头示意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也举起了手打了个招呼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再这么站着不动的话，可能会被误认为我有事，为了不妨碍她练习，我走掉了。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg020c"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"goto","to":903},{"op":"return"},{"op":"return"}]